          "name": "Bus Factor One",
          "barb": "One maintainer, one proprietary format. What happens when you're on vacation?",
          "asks": "Can somebody else operate, fork, and exit this?",
          "killed_by": "A published spec, an independent implementation, and a documented export path. Two of three is arguable. Zero is fatal.",
          "weight": 7,
          "answered": [
